# Build-time variables (set them in Vercel > Project > Settings > Environment Variables).

# Mobile number written into the downloadable contact card (/kaushik-narumanchi.vcf). Left out if unset.
# (Left commented: an empty value in a local env file would hide one set in the shell.)
# CONTACT_PHONE=

# Optional GitHub token (no scopes needed) to raise the API rate limit for the live project facts.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=
